00:41:12.390 --> 00:41:31.560
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Nobody acknowledges how strange it is that they're talking about high school, given Maricela has missed most of middle school so far. The last time she was here, she was 11 years old. She's now 13. Sixth to eighth grade-- a lot happens between sixth and eighth grade.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>没人承认谈论高中有多奇怪，鉴于Maricela到目前为止已经错过了大部分初中课程。她上次来这里时，她才11岁。她现在13岁。六年级到八年级——六年级和八年级之间发生了太多事情。

00:41:31.560 --> 00:41:50.070
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>I keep thinking of the blip, that thing from The Avengers where Thanos snaps his fingers? It's like Maricela blipped middle school. When she left sixth grade, they were covering early Roman civilization. She missed the entire fall of the Roman Empire-- that was seventh grade-- medieval Europe, too, and the Renaissance.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>我一直想到那个“闪现”，《复仇者联盟》里灭霸打响指的那件事？Maricela就像把初中闪现掉了。她离开六年级时，他们正在讲早期罗马文明。她错过了罗马帝国的整个衰落——那是七年级的事——还有中世纪欧洲，文艺复兴也是。

00:41:50.070 --> 00:42:04.300
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>She also missed geometry, photosynthesis, chemistry. She missed a year and a half of reading and writing. And then, blip, eighth grade. Time to move on. Time to fill out a Google form on the transition to high school.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>她还错过了几何、光合作用、化学。她错过了一年半的阅读和写作。然后，闪现，八年级。是时候继续前进了。是时候填写一份关于高中衔接的谷歌表格了。

