00:42:13.680 --> 00:42:23.700
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Maricela does not look excited.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Maricela看起来并不兴奋。

00:42:23.700 --> 00:42:34.590
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Apparently, Maricela said she wanted to speak with me, but that was now hard to imagine. She was barely speaking to anyone. I couldn't imagine her feeling comfortable enough to share anything.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>显然，Maricela说她想和我谈谈，但现在很难想象了。她几乎没跟任何人说话。我无法想象她能感到自在到分享任何事情。

00:42:34.590 --> 00:42:38.740
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Do you want to go into-- there's, like, a little office. Or do you rather want to sit here?
