<v Chana Joffe-Walt>A short, agonizing walk through the hall, kids watching us, Maricela intently studying the floor tiles. We get to the room.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>穿过大厅的一段短暂、痛苦的行走，孩子们看着我们，Maricela专心地研究地砖。我们到了房间。

