<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Here we go. You can sit right there.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>就是这里。你坐在那儿就行。

00:42:56.050 --> 00:43:05.130
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>But then, as soon as we were in this room, I'd barely asked a question-- I said, so I talked to your mom, and then Maricela was telling me about her mom.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>但随后，我们一进这个房间，我还没问什么问题——我说，我跟你妈妈谈过了，然后Maricela就开始告诉我关于她妈妈的事。

00:43:05.130 --> 00:43:10.890
<v Maricela>She helps people, because she even helped this lady. She was, like, 21, and she had a dog.
<v Maricela>她帮助别人，因为她甚至帮助过这位女士。她才21岁，有一条狗。

00:43:10.890 --> 00:43:23.850
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>She was our neighbor, but then she got kicked out because the dog was biting the walls. I'd make them food. I'm a really good cook, way better than my sister. Did you know I have a sister? I don't have to go to movement class today, because I have an injury. I have a note. Do you want to see?
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>她是我们的邻居，但后来因为狗咬墙被赶出来了。我会给她们做饭。我是一个很好的厨师，比我妹妹强多了。你知道我有妹妹吗？我今天不用去运动课，因为我受伤了。我有字条。你想看吗？

00:43:23.850 --> 00:43:33.570
<v Maricela>I'm scared to play soccer now, because we had a leak at the old apartment. And I, like, messed up my knee. And there's sometimes where my bone just pops out. I, like, just fall.
<v Maricela>我现在不敢踢球了，因为旧公寓漏水了。我，弄伤了膝盖。有时我的骨头会蹦出来。我会直接摔倒。

00:43:33.570 --> 00:43:43.650
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>My sister doesn't even help me, Maricela says. Did you know I have a sister? Yeah, she's younger. A brother, too. But the sister's really annoying. When she doesn't get what she wants, she smacks me.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>我妹妹甚至不帮我，Maricela说。你知道我有妹妹吗？是的，她是小的。还有个弟弟。但妹妹真的很烦人。当她得不到她想要的东西时，她会打我。

00:43:43.650 --> 00:43:49.110
<v Maricela>And then, when I told my mom, she says, no, I didn't. And she talks a lot. [CHUCKLES]
<v Maricela>然后，当我告诉我妈妈时，她说，没有，我没打。她说话太多了。（轻笑）

00:43:49.110 --> 00:44:04.800
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Maricela talks a lot about everything. I had assumed when I saw her in the hallway there was no way I was going to get her to tell me what happened. Where was she that whole time? Was she just at home? What'd she do? And what happened with school?
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Maricela关于每件事都说了很多。当我看到她在走廊里时，我以为没法让她告诉我发生了什么。那段时间她去哪儿了？她只是在家里吗？她干什么了？学校发生了什么？

00:44:04.800 --> 00:44:08.190
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>OK, so let me ask you about school.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>好的，让我问你关于学校的事。

00:44:08.190 --> 00:44:16.620
<v Maricela>In sixth grade, I went to this school. And then I missed one year of school, because I had to go to Mexico.
<v Maricela>六年级时，我去了这所学校。然后我错过了一年，因为我必须去墨西哥。

00:44:16.620 --> 00:44:17.790
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Why?
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>为什么？

00:44:17.790 --> 00:44:28.740
<v Maricela>Huh? Because at that time, it was like my grandma and my grandpa were, like, really sick. And then, being over there, we had to take care of my grandma, my grandpa.
<v Maricela>哈？因为那时候，我的奶奶和爷爷病得很重。在那边，我们必须照顾爷爷奶奶。

00:44:28.740 --> 00:44:45.570
<v Maricela>My grandpa's mom, she had COVID in the same house we lived in. She had COVID, and she was sitting down at her bed when she started, like, hallucinating. And then, she passed away. After that, my grandpa and my grandma got sick.
<v Maricela>爷爷的妈妈，她和我们住在一个房子里。她得了新冠，当她开始，比如，产生幻觉时，她坐在床上。然后，她去世了。在那之后，爷爷奶奶也病了。

00:44:45.570 --> 00:44:51.540
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Maricela and her siblings had to isolate in a room, so they wouldn't get sick too, for weeks.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Maricela和她的兄弟姐妹必须隔离在一个房间里，这样他们就不会病倒，持续了数周。

00:44:51.540 --> 00:44:56.580
<v Maricela>My mom's oldest sister had to, like, leave the food, like, outside our doors.
