00:44:56.580 --> 00:45:02.190
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>So you were just living in a room with your siblings, not able to leave the room, getting food delivered to the door?
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>所以你只是和兄弟姐妹住在一个房间里，不能离开房间，等着食物送到门口？

