01:06:01.270 --> 01:06:16.980
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Thanks, as always, to my boss, Ira Glass. He's out this week, because he's trying to branch out from radio and make it onto the US gymnastics team, 2024 Olympics. But I'm a little worried he's making a lot of enemies at the tryouts.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>一如既往感谢我的老板Ira Glass。他这周不在，因为他正试图从广播转向进军美国体操队，参加2024年奥运会。但我有点担心他在选拔赛上树敌太多。

01:06:16.980 --> 01:06:19.390
<v MJ>[LAUGHS] Oh, you're doing cartwheels? OK.
<v MJ>（大笑）哦，你在做侧手翻？OK。

01:06:19.390 --> 01:06:24.390
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>I'm Chana Joffe-Walt. Ira will be back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>我是Chana Joffe-Walt。Ira下周会回来带来更多《美国生活》的故事。
